        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;box-sizing:border-box;container-type:inline-size;background:#ffffff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b0b12'><div style='max-width:980px;margin:0 auto'><div style='background:#0b0b12;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding-top:14px;padding-bottom:14px;padding-left:clamp(20px,5cqw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,5cqw,48px)'><span style='font:600 13px/1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#f5c542'>TWILITE</span><span style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font:400 13px/1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/root.node' style='color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none'>Library</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/root.node' style='color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none'>The Twilite Zone</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/starters/start-with-your-ai/root.node' style='background:#f5c542;color:#0b0b12;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none'>Start free</a></span></div><div style='background:#5b21b6;padding-top:clamp(32px,7cqw,56px);padding-bottom:clamp(28px,5cqw,44px);padding-left:clamp(20px,5cqw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,5cqw,48px)'><div style='max-width:560px'><div style='font:700 12px/16px Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#f5c542;margin-bottom:14px'>DURABLE KNOWLEDGE FOR HUMANS AND AI</div><h1 style='margin:0;font:400 clamp(34px,7cqw,52px)/1.06 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#ffffff'>Tell your AI what you want to keep track of.</h1><p style='margin:16px 0 22px;font:400 17px/1.6 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ede9fe'>Twilite turns its answer into a graph you can see, change, and keep. One paste, and your project is on the canvas.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap'><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/starters/start-with-your-ai/root.node' style='display:inline-block;background:#f5c542;color:#0b0b12;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:8px;font:600 15px/1.2 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;text-decoration:none'>Start with your AI</a><a href='#editor' style='color:#ffffff;font:400 14px/1.2 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #f5c542;padding-bottom:2px;text-decoration:none'>See what the editor adds</a></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px'><div style='flex:1 1 150px;min-width:150px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #f5c542;padding:10px 14px'><div style='font:700 11px/16px Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#5b21b6'>GOAL · IN PROGRESS</div><div style='font:500 15px/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b0b12;margin-top:4px'>Finish the kitchen</div></div><div style='flex:1 1 150px;min-width:150px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #5b21b6;padding:10px 14px'><div style='font:700 11px/16px Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#5b21b6'>TASK · TO DO</div><div style='font:500 15px/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b0b12;margin-top:4px'>Collect three quotes</div></div><div style='flex:1 1 150px;min-width:150px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #0b0b12;padding:10px 14px'><div style='font:700 11px/16px Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#5b21b6'>QUESTION · OPEN</div><div style='font:500 15px/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b0b12;margin-top:4px'>Open it up, or keep the layout?</div></div></div></div><div style='background:#ffffff;padding-top:34px;padding-bottom:30px;padding-left:clamp(20px,5cqw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,5cqw,48px)'><div style='font:700 12px/16px Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b21b6'>How it works</div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:16px'><div><div style='font:400 34px/1 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#5b21b6'>1</div><div style='font:600 16px/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b0b12;margin:6px 0 4px'>Tell your AI</div><div style='font:400 14px/1.55 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#444444'>Copy the guide, give it to ChatGPT or Gemini, and say what you want to keep track of.</div></div><div><div style='font:400 34px/1 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#5b21b6'>2</div><div style='font:600 16px/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b0b12;margin:6px 0 4px'>Paste its reply</div><div style='font:400 14px/1.55 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#444444'>Your goal, tasks, and questions land on the canvas, ready to read.</div></div><div><div style='font:400 34px/1 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#5b21b6'>3</div><div style='font:600 16px/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b0b12;margin:6px 0 4px'>Keep going</div><div style='font:400 14px/1.55 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#444444'>Ask for more in the same chat. Change a card yourself. It all stays one graph.</div></div></div><div style='margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;font:400 13px/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#444444'>Tried with ChatGPT and Gemini. It works in the chat you already use.</div></div><div